# Calliope engine

- Decks ship through `./scripts/calliope.sh <slug> …`.
- Visual system = `theme/calliope.css` only.
- Prefer compose mode for new decks; hand mode for large existing narratives.
- Skills: `calliope-loop`, `calliope-outline`, `calliope-build`.
